WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
♪ ♪

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:11.792
The mighty Baba Voss.

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:15.417
A fearless warrior
in a world without sight.

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:21.125
Everyone close to you
always ends up suffering.

00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:26.125
Now it's your turn, brother.

00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:32.875
I swore I would never
return here.

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:34.917
Edo took my daughter.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:40.792
♪ She would never say
where she came from ♪

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:45.041
I'm going to find out
where he's hiding her.

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:46.625
♪ Yesterday don't matter
if it's gone ♪

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.375
What do you see?

00:00:53.417 --> 00:00:54.417
A shift in the world.

00:00:55.708 --> 00:01:00.166
♪ Goodbye Ruby Tuesday ♪

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.792
We are chosen to usher
in a new world.

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:09.500
I carry within me a child
born with God's gift of vision.

00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:12.667
[shouting]

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:15.542
Sight will return,

00:01:16.792 --> 00:01:18.375
and the first nation
to harness its powers

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:20.834
will dominate the world.

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.792
You're declaring war
on the greatest military force

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.083
in the world.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.125
This is not our fight!

00:01:33.959 --> 00:01:36.500
If we walk away,
thousands of people will die.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:39.917
[grunting]

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:44.250
I know this enemy.

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.333
I was this enemy!

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.000
They fight to enslave!

00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:51.750
We fight for freedom!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.834
I say we open our gate
right now...

00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:01.333
...and welcome them to hell.

00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:04.083
[cheering]

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:09.875
There are weapons more powerful
than swords.

00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:14.542
They won't defeat our future.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.041
Welcome home, Baba.

00:02:25.208 --> 00:02:29.583
♪ Goodbye, Ruby Tuesday ♪

